sioned replacement-slice record identifying incumbent behavior, actual Gravity source and explicitly preserved, narrowed, delegated and unsupported operations with profile/target/provider and migration provenance. Refusals: Reject a replacement claim omitting a known narrowed/unsupported behavior, silently treating a delegated operation as native replacement or losing the incumbent comparison basis. Evidence: retain the exact source/compiler/profile/target and applicable provider/checker identities, actual positive products and negative diagnostics for this criterion. Consume these actual dependency artifacts (not whole-component completion): pipeline - Versioned stage contracts and actual compiler stage/fact/origin products."},
